parameters.text:
=Synthesize this competitor intelligence into actionable insights for {{ $('Set Competitor Config').item.json.your_store }}.

Competitors: {{ $('Set Competitor Config').item.json.competitors }}

Pricing Activity:
{{ $('Scan Competitor Pricing').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Promotion Activity:
{{ $('Scan Competitor Promotions').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Customer Sentiment:
{{ $('Scan Competitor Reviews').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}

Return JSON:
{
  "pricing_changes": [{"competitor": "", "change": "", "impact": "high/medium/low"}],
  "active_promotions": [{"competitor": "", "promo": "", "ends": ""}],
  "competitor_weaknesses": [],
  "opportunities_to_exploit": [],
  "threats_to_watch": [],
  "recommended_actions": [],
  "urgency": "high/medium/low",
  "daily_summary": "2-3 sentence summary"
}

=🚨 *HIGH URGENCY: Competitor Activity — {{ $now.toFormat('MMM dd') }}*

{{ $json.daily_summary }}

*Pricing Changes:*
{{ $json.pricing_changes.map(p=>`• ${p.competitor}: ${p.change}`).join('\n') }}

*Active Promotions:*
{{ $json.active_promotions.map(p=>`• ${p.competitor}: ${p.promo}`).join('\n') }}

*Immediate Actions:*
{{ $json.recommended_actions.map(a=>`• ${a}`).join('\n') }}
